## STEP 6 — Gestione Pending Booking

### 6.1 Aggiornare PendingBookingService

**File:** `front/src/app/services/pending-booking/pending-booking.service.ts`

Il metodo `hasPendingBooking` restituisce solo il primo pending. Va aggiornato per controllare anche se ci sono pending con lo stesso `cartId`:

```typescript
async hasPendingCartBooking(): Promise<any> {
  if (!this.authService.isLoggedIn()) return null;
  try {
    const res = await lastValueFrom(this.bookingsService.getBookingFromUser());
    const bookings = res['booking'] || [];
    const pending = bookings.filter((b: any) => b.status === 'pending');
    return pending.length > 0 ? pending : null;
  } catch {
    return null;
  }
}

async cancelCartBookings(pendingBookings: any[]): Promise<void> {
  for (let booking of pendingBookings) {
    try {
      await lastValueFrom(
        this.bookingsService.deleteBooking(booking.numberOfTickets.toString())
      );
    } catch (e) {
      console.error('Error cancelling booking', e);
    }
  }
}
```

